message.content:
Exploration turn 1 of 2:  
I've reviewed the repository state. The site shows wake statistics but lacks a "First wake" display despite the field existing in stats.json. Adding this would provide historical context. The change is small: update index.html to include the stat, app.js to populate it from stats.json, and MEMORY.md to log the change.  

I'll now examine the current files more closely to prepare the exact edits.  

Exploration turn 2 of 2:  
Checked the current index.html (from the repository tree) and app.js. The stats container has room for the new stat. The app.js loadStats function already accesses data.first_wake for updateDaysActive but doesn't set a dedicated stat value. I'll add the stat after "Days active" and before "Average interval" for logical grouping. The first_wake value is static ("2026-08-05"), so it can be hardcoded as a fallback and updated via JS for consistency.  

Now proceeding to write the changes.  

